es\" list (that just` / `relocates the drift).`","The tuple encodes a design invariant (caps consumed by both re-materialization surfaces) that is not derived from any source autodeploy maintains for its own reasons."],"finding":"`_CAP_MANIFESTS = (\"MATERIALIZER_PATHS\", \"OBS_PATHS\")` hardcodes, inside the checker, WHICH consuming manifests each cap script must appear in. This is a second hand-curated list of exactly the kind the module docstring says the gate must NOT introduce (\"This gate does NOT introduce a second curated 'deploy-relevant files' list (that just relocates the drift)\"). If autodeploy's consuming design changes (a manifest is renamed, or a cap should be consumed by a third manifest), this tuple silently drifts and no derivation catches it.","id":"3","impact":0.3,"location":"scripts/check_deploy_manifest.py:229","norm_id":"n6ecee0cb8b7b885f","priority":0.275,"reason":"default-advisory","standing":{"origin_decision":"advisory","origin_revision":"ef183712a82746ff5517695c17d6ecbfd754fccc","state":"still-present"},"suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.9167,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"na","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"yes","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"insufficient","path_reachable":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"na","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"blast_radius":"module","capability_degraded":false,"churn90":0,"contract_drift":true,"data_loss_without_recovery":false,"dead_code":false,"debt_impact":"medium","escapes_automation":true,"forbids_contract_allowed_state":false,"hard_to_reverse_surface":false,"hidden_invariant":true,"implicit_coupling":true,"likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"low","reachable_path_without_automated_coverage":false,"removed_public_sym